from your victim and can use it for yourself at talent level %d.\n\t\tAt talent level 5 you can choose which talent to use.\n\t\tYou may not steal a talent which you already know.\n\t\tThe stolen talent will not use any resources to activate.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"正在被你消化的目标承受着极大的痛苦，内部器官不断破损，让你能趁机侵入它的思维。\n\t\t你可以窃取并使用它的一个随机技能（技能等级 %d）。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，你可以指定窃取的技能。\n\t\t你不能窃取你已知的技能。\n\t\t窃取的技能使用时不消耗资源。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"246c06da488e7b9fb1f633b5fc2c18bea296ffed7885ed42a3835965f32ac78a","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f8318336e625de154323accd8bf53f76a02e0ee8be29e6abf918a25064a53267","logical_entry_identity":"022dc5262d1e12bc50237a30d074f12ccf5f11ded9897bc0e702422a11b08744","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"%s resists the splinters!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 抵抗了玻璃碎片！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"499e2fe08d655c4d4c5e0b70c2613a9f526e7469da035044086194ca55984ea5","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f8616ad7387b6c12d24ba37320288989b43c0464e77d4ebc40cc9c041d18bf22","logical_entry_identity":"99e52894b9f37332961a584b662caa6472b98821f72684392b057e9afdb28240","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#This was a very satisfying meal, 'you' feel strengthened. (+1 generic talent point)","source_tag":"log","target":"#CRIMSON#这份餐营养丰富，“你”觉得自己变强了（+1通用技能点）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"983e8845233cc671e52dd96de8e8894e30239bcacc22269eaae841e525d913ce","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f880a14da8e834dc598f77166bcf081b8b592fd5b1da074026e8647462e4ec2f","logical_entry_identity":"4cedbbbed3ea573ae8a8ec091cfbf89f0cb9e1d9ea20294fe937e48d11d14af3","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"disease","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"疾病"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d7e0c22567bead0bb30ce0bd065e0acda7f01477c42b4e2010da786c2871368e","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f8b859da0a0e9f5cfe55b0ed35e8319fde7c9fe692dfe2fc121c6493fdc41468","logical_entry_identity":"17ad6b7789ca642f53d5fa6ff3edcd78032cc7530312804df01b71d9ee60b1a8","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"The target is doomed to madness. All talent cooldowns are increased by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标注定陷入疯狂。所有技能冷却时间增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a1c3500b7f7c24c1742c3ef34be8ef4cc5a4a5cf6c34560b416015f7e303baea","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f8d922c5969f6ad9b7079ab6cd477c4f8af6dbb693b69d96c9df93b886b051dd","logical_entry_identity":"ce01c2e7ba6f05dd502c8452394980930d77c629eabb518b58de044d5aece7d6","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"%s (empowered)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s（强化）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9a2f2850064ea9c0bae8f12e3acf80ea80cf2d10d33bb5d6baeeb83cacf8eeae","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f8ea60491849e3a4cfe8373fc50a1c2c125c93de5a02faa0bfd645abaae1adc3","logical_entry_identity":"94092aa0c5a7e963324aa209b1255303081884c680086473a3e3d8f8b4832ca3","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"This spell will be the most important you will learn from me. Fate is a force made up of many threads. Provided that you understand how the threads all connect to each other, you can manipulate it to your own ends. This spell will allow you to pass on doomed threads from you onto your opponents, escaping from your own preordained death. Remember that this spell should not be used lightly and that some threads do not bend to anyone's will, no matter how hard you pull.\n\nThe target dummies have been imbued with fake void energies; use your Fatebreaker on them and then use Netherblast on yourself while low on life. This is a difficult exercise, students. Be aware that you are now risking your life if you execute it wrong.\n\n#{italic}#Go check your new spell for detailed information.#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个法术将会是你从我身上学到的最重要的法术。命运是由无数世界线组成的力量。如果你能够理解世界线之间的复杂线索，你甚至可以操纵你自己的命运。这个法术将会让你可以从注定你的死亡中逃脱，将自己毁灭的世界线转移到其他人的身上。请记住，这个法术不应该被轻率使用，有些世界线不屈从于任何人的意志，你花再大的力气也永远无法操纵它们。\n\n这些训练假人身上灌注着虚假的虚空能量。在它们身上使用“打破宿命”，然后在你的血量很低的时候对自己使用彼世冲击。这个练习有点困难，孩子们，一定要小心注意，如果你的操作错误，你就是在冒生命危险。\n\n#{italic}#查看你的新法术，了解详情。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"074071d7e1f3e279c15e727bb32185aa062ab4942b1e5f6f926d32445ae1d599","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f91dda2847f4c5d4f798ff19501a7f60a42e508e07cd4f6ff76cd5ae9b7a0adb","logical_entry_identity":"2ee0e8f5bfdeadab60ad49365334e00e85ef7f217ac10ad521a06ff84c1ea887","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Prophecy","source_tag":"talent name","target":"预言"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"35c8697b17ce9b4a713b064333b10dcd3bed52476ed75b643d3a658399e6ec6c","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f963d7fdde483ef59f5f68963f95114ca39686a8bf8e63c6f577ddc4770755c5","logical_entry_identity":"f2ed93be08f56861e70acf8eaee05c0d8b1e51e30c0b853c83b2083087c5dbc7","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Beard 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"络腮胡1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"714f22876a28e12babb499849df11a842b7c4c74cd5497d50dda165734c48663","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f98443f5cadb8fc5ba4497fc54869c84fb889af289d70d77288e78cfe4d23777","logical_entry_identity":"6e3112b621af4be70e6b0764c4a48ec1411f0091f669a9ad86ee0255d06a05ec","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Tentacle Constriction","source_tag":"_t","target":"触手缠绕"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"901c3e11d2ae34dad9c5507511a51a89c68d1971f735c53fdfb882d870f86b8c","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f9a646e30a6a81b001ea3dc732216f3dd6fc2e6275fe2488f404413baf9d136a","logical_entry_identity":"1033883d53747e989a8bbd277c8e0675971d17ea7806f306cb152dd68c386cc4","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"#Target# is empowered by the pain of its victim.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被牺牲者的痛苦强化。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f124d7de4c248888557283be760f8307e753cf8a321cc2d28ef03dc158f9e386","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"f9b6ad57445191cc75656ef430e1b1193b048d1b4cf32